<title>JAPAN: M'bishi Materials to issue 50 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>M'bishi Materials to issue 50 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Mitsubishi Materials Corp</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nikko Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Tokyo-Mitsubishi Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible	    ISSUE NO   4     AMT   50 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON 0.95%(tentativel)  ISS PRICE  PAR   MATURITY 30.Sep.05</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Nov.96   CONV TO 29.Sep.05</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 30.Sep.96  INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 11.Sep-25.Sep</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on September 10.</p>
</text>
